Subject: [PATCH 3/6] BlueOS: Etar: Widgets 0.6.1

- Cards keep an 8 dp margin inside their cells; the countdown uses the
  normal card with the number in the accent color.
- The countdown is placed right away and set up by a tap
  (configuration_optional).

Change-Id: Ib00333a8762374459ae2d418cab8ee6e1d5406a8
